					)
				)
			)
			(property "Description" "Abracon PRO-IS-237 (formerly ProAnt InSide-2400 -- ProAnt was acquired by Abracon and u-blox now lists this antenna under the Abracon PN): 2.4GHz patch antenna, +3.0dBi gain, 50 ohm, 27x12mm triangular, U.FL connector + 100mm cable. RE-VERIFIED for NINA-B400 against the real u-blox NINA-B4 series certification application note UBX-20037320 R05, Section 3.2 'Single band antennas' -- entry 'Wi-Fi / Bluetooth / Bluetooth LE board antenna, PN PRO-IS-237' matches this part exactly on every listed spec (gain, impedance, 27x12mm triangular, patch, 100mm cable, U.FL) and is PRE-APPROVED for NINA-B4 with FCC, IC, RED, UKCA, MIC, NCC, KCC, ANATEL, ACMA and ICASA. u-blox's own comment on the entry -- 'Should be attached to a plastic enclosure or part for best performance' -- still makes it the right pick for a wearable wristband, the same reason it was chosen off the NINA-B1 list. Connects directly to the NINA-B400's ON-MODULE U.FL connector; the previous PCB-side U.FL receptacle (J2) and L/C matching network (L1/C13) are removed as they are no longer needed. NOTE: u-blox's certification note requires the U.FL reference design be followed to keep FCC/IC modular approval."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
			)
